From 4e90fd2889058b85b5e1e02f4f83bca90ac057ec Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>
Date: Thu, 12 Nov 2026 04:20:57 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] Conversation mode: multi-turn planning chat on LangGraph
 (checkpointed, guarded, plan-only)

- chat/: per-turn structured draft with deterministic merge + readiness, LangGraph
  graph (understand -> await_user interrupt -> build_plan), SQLite checkpointing,
  secret masking before storage, turn/size limits, in-graph error recovery
- api/chat_routes.py: /api/chat/sessions (start, message, build, get, list, delete)
- UI: Conversation tab with live 'Draft so far' panel, resume on refresh, history
- db: chat_sessions table; lock engine creation (fixes first-start table race)
- plan_summary.py: shared rationale/guardrail/usage helpers (moved out of app.py)
- deps: langgraph, langgraph-checkpoint-sqlite; README; 23 new tests
